## Customizing Colors in Settings

Colors can also be overridden globally, in settings:

```json
    "editor.semanticTokenColorCustomizations": {
        "rules": {
            "templateType": {
                "foreground": "#ff0000",
                "fontStyle": "italic bold underline"
            }
        }
    }
```

Or, overridden on a per-theme basis:

```json
    "editor.semanticTokenColorCustomizations": {
        "[Visual Studio Dark]": {
            "rules": {
                "templateType": {
                    "foreground": "#ff0000",
                    "fontStyle": "italic bold underline"
                }
            }
        }
    }
```
